					<![CDATA[
						 <p>以下是SunnyClockwork的艺术作品集。</p> <h3><span>禁忌之地</span></h3> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;显示图片</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;隐藏图片</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div style="border: 1px solid #000;"> <div style="height: 100%;"> <div class="image-container aligncenter"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/local--files/sunny-art-series-5/dcs7a9v-7e3a9860-3aaf-4f19-8e57-b4d06b375de0.jpg" title="禁忌之地" alt="禁忌之地" width="400" class="image" /></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <h3><span>禁忌之地 (MS Paint)</span></h3> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;显示图片</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;隐藏图片</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div style="border: 1px solid #000;"> <div style="height: 100%;"> <div class="image-container aligncenter"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/sunny-art-series-5/%E7%A6%81%E5%BF%8CMSP" title="禁忌之地 (MS Paint)" alt="禁忌之地 (MS Paint)" width="400" class="image" /></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <h3><span>SCP-4002 - 黑月嚎叫于时界之外</span></h3> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;显示图片</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;隐藏图片</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div style="border: 1px solid #000;"> <div style="height: 100%;"> <div class="image-container aligncent