				<title>SCP-1004</title>
				<link>http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1004</link>
				<description>

&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-block block-right&quot; style=&quot;width:300px;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/adult:scp-1004/Factoryporncd.jpg&quot; style=&quot;width:300px;&quot; alt=&quot;Factoryporncd.jpg&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-caption&quot; style=&quot;width:300px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-1004的最新版&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
